    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple compile functor: Takes a single IR module and returns an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_object_file" kindref="compound">ObjectFile</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This compiler supports a single compilation thread and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_l_l_v_m_context" kindref="compound">LLVMContext</ref> only. For multithreaded compilation, use <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_concurrent_i_r_compiler" kindref="compound">ConcurrentIRCompiler</ref> below. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
